      <description>&lt;p&gt;These are some of the Cellular Automaton that I have generated using custom rule sets that I tinkered around with during 2021! Check my Github for the Source Code for all these:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;mosaic-grid&#34; id=&#34;mosaic-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;https://janeetbajracharya.com.np/images/ca-gallery/dinosaurs.gif&#34; alt=&#34;Description of gif 1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://janeetbajracharya.com.np/images/ca-gallery/3x&amp;#43;1.gif&#34; alt=&#34;Description of gif 3&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://janeetbajracharya.com.np/images/ca-gallery/dark.gif&#34; alt=&#34;Description of gif 4&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://janeetbajracharya.com.np/images/ca-gallery/int.gif&#34; alt=&#34;Description of gif 5&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://janeetbajracharya.com.np/images/ca-gallery/z2.gif&#34; alt=&#34;Description of gif 6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://janeetbajracharya.com.np/images/ca-gallery/bruh.gif&#34; alt=&#34;Chemistry Reaction&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;style&gt;&#xA;  .mosaic-grid {&#xA;    column-count: 1;&#xA;    column-gap: 1rem;&#xA;    width: 100%;&#xA;    margin: 2rem 0;&#xA;  }&#xA;&#xA;  @media (min-width: 600px) { .mosaic-grid { column-count: 2; } }&#xA;  @media (min-width: 900px) { .mosaic-grid { column-count: 3; } }&#xA;&#xA;   &#xA;  .mosaic-grid img {&#xA;    width: 100% !important;&#xA;    height: auto !important;&#xA;    display: block !important;&#xA;    margin: 0 0 1rem 0 !important;  &#xA;    break-inside: avoid;&#xA;    border: none !important;&#xA;    padding: 0 !important;&#xA;    box-shadow: none !important;&#xA;    border-radius: 4px;&#xA;  }&#xA;&#xA;   &#xA;  .mosaic-grid p {&#xA;    margin: 0 !important;&#xA;    padding: 0 !important;&#xA;    display: contents;  &#xA;  }&#xA;&lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;script&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  document.addEventListener(&#34;DOMContentLoaded&#34;, function() {&#xA;    const grid = document.getElementById(&#34;mosaic-0&#34;);&#xA;    const images = grid.getElementsByTagName(&#39;img&#39;);&#xA;    for (let img of images) {&#xA;      &#xA;      img.parentElement.style.breakInside = &#34;avoid&#34;;&#xA;      img.parentElement.style.display = &#34;inline-block&#34;;&#xA;      img.parentElement.style.width = &#34;100%&#34;;&#xA;    }&#xA;  });&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;</description>
